1
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:09,230
♪La la la la la la, la la la la la la♪

2
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:12,740
♪La la la la la la la la la♪

3
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:16,330
♪No matter what day it is,
I'll spend it with you♪

4
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:19,100
♪We're more sure
of each other than ever♪

5
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,060
=Watching Heart Signal with You=

6
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:25,780
(Heart Signal)

7
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:27,980
=Watching Heart Signal with You=

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,120
Hi, everyone. I was
on Season 8 of Heart Signal.

9
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,880
(Fang Yijiong, Heart Signal S8 guest)
I'm Fang Yijiong of the RuYi couple.

10
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:32,880
Hello, everyone.

11
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,480
I was also on Season 8 of Heart Signal.

12
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,400
(Xu Rulan, Heart Signal S8 guest)
I'm Xu Rulan of the RuYi couple.

13
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,440
I'm here with Dr. Fang
on Watching Heart Signal with You.

14
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:39,080
Hello, everyone.

15
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:41,320
I was a guest
on Season 6 of Heart Signal.

16
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,360
We are

17
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:44,200
the JinZhao couple.

18
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,720
(Zhang Jin, Heart Signal S6 guest)
You can call me Lucky.

19
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:47,120
Hello, everyone.

20
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:47,960
It's still me.

21
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,820
(Zeng Zhaohao, Heart Signal S6 guest)
Lucky's fiance, Zeng Zhaohao.

22
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:50,420
(Sweet)

23
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:51,500
(Even sweeter)

24
00:00:52,280 --> 00:00:52,800
It makes me

25
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:53,540
seems so...

26
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:54,420
(Low-key)

27
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:57,440
After the last episode,

28
00:00:57,440 --> 00:00:59,840
did any guest stand out to you?

29
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,800
(Sha Yue'er and Zhao Xilun)
I'm looking forward to those two.

30
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:05,560
(Looking forward to their story)
I wonder what happens next.

31
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:06,880
I'm also curious

32
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,640
about the independent type.

33
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:11,940
Now that you mention it, yes.

34
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:14,600
He hasn't really talked much yet.

35
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,520
Right. And when he entered that space,

36
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,120
everyone had already
talked to each other.

37
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,560
I'm looking forward to his story.

38
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:21,760
Me too.

39
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,120
Last time, we tried

40
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:26,080
to predict who liked whom
and the voting results.

41
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,180
We picked Cui Kaiyi and Chen Hewen.

42
00:01:27,180 --> 00:01:27,880
(Men's pick:
Cui Kaiyi and Chen Hewen)

43
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:28,240
Right.

44
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:31,420
We picked Sha Yue'er and Sun Bohan.

45
00:01:31,420 --> 00:01:32,310
(Women's pick: Sha Yue'er and Sun Bohan)
Okay.

46
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:33,800
Are we about to see the answer?

47
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:34,440
Yes.

48
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:35,680
Can't wait.

49
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:36,700
We're going to win.

50
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:37,660
(Calling the win early)

51
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:42,280
Let's see what happened between them.

52
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:45,300
(Red pocket square)

53
00:01:45,340 --> 00:01:47,940
(Yellow dress)

54
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,640
That dinner party was quite eventful.

55
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,280
Yes.

56
00:01:50,840 --> 00:01:51,400
Let's watch.

57
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:53,660
(What did they see?)

58
00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:55,180
(Instantly gets it)

59
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:58,080
I have to say,
he looks just like Sun Jingjun.

60
00:01:58,820 --> 00:01:59,620
(Chen Hewen, Heart Signal S9 guest)

61
00:01:59,620 --> 00:02:00,460
(Sun Jingjun, Heart Signal S6 guest)

62
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,400
A new friend.

63
00:02:01,460 --> 00:02:02,420
(I'll be there next episode!)

64
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,800
They really look alike.

65
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,760
This girl is gorgeous.

66
00:02:09,950 --> 00:02:12,430
Hello.

67
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:13,660
(First-impression choice)

68
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,480
Are they revealing the results?

69
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:20,240
Let's see what's going on.

70
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:22,700
(Zhao Xilun, Cui Yihang, Chen Hewen,
Yu Yang and Sha Yue'er) Four votes.

71
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:24,840
It really is four votes.

72
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:28,860
(Not a still image)

73
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,080
It's these two who cast two votes.

74
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:35,280
They made the same two choices.

75
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:37,920
They both chose the people

76
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:40,240
they first met in the same room.

77
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,680
Makes sense.

78
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,080
So did Wu Siying

79
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:46,120
seem rather introverted?

80
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:49,880
She may be more of a slow-burn type.

81
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:52,740
Guess where I'm from.

82
00:02:53,910 --> 00:02:54,700
(Checking again)
From Northeast China?

83
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:55,430
Jilin?

84
00:02:56,460 --> 00:02:57,220
(Happy)

85
00:02:57,220 --> 00:02:58,420
Guess her zodiac sign.

86
00:02:58,420 --> 00:02:58,900
A water sign.

87
00:02:59,110 --> 00:02:59,700
You're good.

88
00:02:59,940 --> 00:03:01,200
(Right on the first try)
Let's give her a round of applause.

89
00:03:03,550 --> 00:03:04,420
So you're...

90
00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:04,970
You're an introvert?

91
00:03:04,970 --> 00:03:05,610
I am.

92
00:03:05,610 --> 00:03:06,250
An introvert.

93
00:03:06,250 --> 00:03:07,750
You were surrounded by guys,
sitting right in the middle.

94
00:03:07,750 --> 00:03:08,770
If it were me,

95
00:03:08,770 --> 00:03:09,620
I'd be shy too.

96
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:12,120
I tried putting myself in her shoes.

97
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:14,400
If I were having dinner
with a bunch of guys,

98
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,600
I don't think

99
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:17,400
I could be that relaxed.

100
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,800
I'd be under a lot of pressure.

101
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:21,040
(Nervous just thinking about it)
I'd probably feel awkward too.

102
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,400
(Getting carried away)
A little carried away, huh?

103
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,600
A little carried away, huh?

104
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:25,000
They all voted for me.

105
00:03:25,820 --> 00:03:26,880
(That does sound pretty good)

106
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:27,880
That's what you mean, right?

107
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:28,440
Am I right?

108
00:03:29,260 --> 00:03:30,220
(Playful)

109
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:32,920
Lan, if you were in that situation,

110
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:34,200
what would you do?

111
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:36,840
I think I'd be the observer.

112
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:38,020
(Quietly observing)

113
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:42,400
I'd probably let them

114
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,080
take the lead in the conversation.

115
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:44,640
Right.

116
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:45,960
What about you, Dr. Fang?

117
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:47,520
Same as Lan, I think.

118
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,120
I'd definitely observe first.

119
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:49,680
Right.

120
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,800
Unless the topic really interested me,
then I might talk more.

121
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,800
I usually wait for others
to ask me something,

122
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,280
then I answer their questions.

123
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,280
If I were the only guy there,

124
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:58,840
I'd try my best to fit in.

125
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:03,160
(Trying his best)
I'd do what I could.

126
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,240
If I couldn't fit in, so be it.

127
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:04,680
Right?

128
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,160
What if you were in the majority?

129
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:08,240
I'd probably observe too.

130
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:12,320
Is this the independent guy
from earlier?

131
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:13,080
(Excited)
The independent type.

132
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:13,880
Yes.

133
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:16,700
(Cao Yiheng, Sun Qimeng, Wu Siying)

134
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:19,800
(Women: Sun Bohan; Men: Chen Hewen)
We never saw that coming.

135
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:22,400
Maybe they wanted
to see what he was really like.

136
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:23,600
He's so mysterious.

137
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,080
Did you girls guess correctly?

138
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:26,720
We got it right.

139
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:27,240
Right.

140
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,480
Neither of you got one right.

141
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:32,080
Dinner's on you.

142
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:32,920
Of course.

143
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,360
Sure, no problem.

144
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:39,160
Someone's here.

145
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:42,240
But now he has the chance

146
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,880
to talk to everyone who arrives later.

147
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:47,520
He can't stay that passive forever.

148
00:04:48,020 --> 00:04:48,510
But actually,

149
00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:51,280
you're quite different in person.

150
00:04:51,280 --> 00:04:53,050
You seem very warm to me.

151
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:53,920
They're so direct.

152
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,800
They're already
discussing each other's personalities.

153
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,920
I thought they'd
make some small talk first

154
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,840
in their first meeting.

155
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,520
Exactly. They're so direct.

156
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,280
Right.

157
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:01,880
Cao Yiheng actually

158
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:03,680
has a lot of energy bottled up.

159
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,880
Maybe he feels like he's fallen behind.

160
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:06,920
(Making his move)
Now he's really stepping it up.

161
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:09,080
I think he's confident and composed.

162
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,440
I'd be anxious if it were me.

163
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,400
If I were sitting there alone.

164
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,680
(Concerned)
You'd feel anxious?

165
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,200
Yes.

166
00:05:19,550 --> 00:05:21,510
I think they were probably surprised

167
00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:22,340
when I showed up.

168
00:05:22,340 --> 00:05:23,400
Not really.

169
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,050
Everyone had been waiting for you.

170
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:27,980
(Lowers her head)

171
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:30,600
That's actually quite heartwarming.

172
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,720
They didn't use your absence

173
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,000
to finish every conversation.

174
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,720
They all knew you were coming

175
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,880
and waited for you to join them.

176
00:05:39,930 --> 00:05:41,620
What kind of person are you hoping

177
00:05:41,620 --> 00:05:43,440
to meet in the house?

178
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:45,760
My key word would be

179
00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:48,530
someone who looks neat and clean.

180
00:05:49,620 --> 00:05:50,940
(The corners of his mouth lift)

181
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:53,080
Do guys actually

182
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,160
(Holding it in)
start thinking every trait

183
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,600
a girl mentions applies to them?

184
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,560
Neat and clean.

185
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:57,920
Yes, they do.

186
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,360
Emotionally stable.

187
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,280
They'd think she means them.

188
00:06:02,860 --> 00:06:05,020
What kind of personality

189
00:06:05,020 --> 00:06:05,810
are you drawn to?

190
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,310
What type do you prefer?

191
00:06:08,340 --> 00:06:09,700
(Purses her lips)

192
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:12,000
Two extroverts

193
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:13,620
(Helping her out)
ganging up on an introvert.

194
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:17,320
Wait, I don't get it.
Was he speaking up for her?

195
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:19,920
He was helping her out.

196
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:23,560
(High energy)
I also felt the mood here was lively

197
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,760
while Wu Siying stayed in the corner.

198
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:26,340
(Shy)

199
00:06:26,940 --> 00:06:28,380
(99% match)

200
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:31,560
That's quite cute.

201
00:06:33,790 --> 00:06:34,380
Here they come.

202
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:37,970
Time to head to the main dinner venue.

203
00:06:37,970 --> 00:06:39,200
Time to meet everyone.

204
00:06:39,550 --> 00:06:40,640
Let's go, everyone.

205
00:06:42,820 --> 00:06:44,580
(The dinner officially begins)

206
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:46,780
Hello.

207
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,000
Everyone has finally met.

208
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,800
There's actually some strategy

209
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,920
in choosing where to sit.

210
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:51,880
Tell us more.

211
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,920
I chose the seat opposite Lan.

212
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:55,040
The seat opposite Lan.

213
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,920
Sitting face-to-face

214
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,920
makes it easier to observe her.

215
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:58,280
Exactly.

216
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,480
Where would you sit?

217
00:06:59,640 --> 00:07:01,120
Anywhere, as long as it's not too far.

218
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,520
What about you?

219
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,480
I'd probably sit beside him.

220
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:06,960
I'd definitely want to talk.

221
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:07,920
I'm talkative.

222
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:12,560
Dr. Fang and Lan,

223
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,520
do you remember last year's dinner?

224
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:16,040
The most memorable part.

225
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,200
Anything come to mind?

226
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:20,080
I think there was a Q&A session.

227
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:22,320
The questions were quite direct.

228
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,800
Some were quite hard to answer.

229
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,360
What about you?

230
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:33,520
Oh, you two.

231
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:34,360
Did you get a difficult question?

232
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,520
No, it wasn't difficult.

233
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:36,680
Wasn't it the question you asked?

234
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:39,840
Right.

235
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:41,240
Right. I sent my message too late.

236
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,640
Do you still regret it now?

237
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:44,560
Do you regret sending it too late?

238
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,680
Not at all.

239
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,920
How could he possibly

240
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:49,400
regret this?

241
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:52,320
I don't think what happens

242
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:54,520
on the first day matters that much.

243
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:56,000
Things can always change later.

244
00:08:00,990 --> 00:08:01,970
Introduce him.

245
00:08:01,970 --> 00:08:02,840
Going first is so stressful.

246
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:03,920
(I'll do it)
Chen Hewen steps up.

247
00:08:04,190 --> 00:08:04,760
I'll go first.

248
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,240
That's bold.

249
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,160
He was fidgeting.

250
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,440
I'll join him.

251
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:15,280
I probably wouldn't dare go first.

252
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:18,960
If everyone were rushing to go,

253
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:20,320
I'd let them go first.

254
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:22,560
But if no one moved at all...

255
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,240
You'd break the ice, right?

256
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,560
You're right.

257
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:27,460
My babe knows when to step up.
He's amazing.

258
00:08:27,460 --> 00:08:28,340
(Praising him)

259
00:08:30,450 --> 00:08:31,170
Yes.

260
00:08:31,170 --> 00:08:32,620
I like it when two people

261
00:08:32,940 --> 00:08:34,250
respect each other

262
00:08:34,250 --> 00:08:35,160
and each other's opinions.

263
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:36,980
I don't like someone too domineering.

264
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:38,800
Babe, am I domineering?

265
00:08:38,800 --> 00:08:39,240
What do you think?

266
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,120
Not at all.

267
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:41,600
Answer me properly.

268
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:43,040
What do you want me to say?

269
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:47,080
We made a bet yesterday

270
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:47,640
about

271
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:48,230
how many people

272
00:08:48,230 --> 00:08:49,050
would enter the Yellow Space.

273
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,700
The loser had to introduce him
to the other person.

274
00:08:50,700 --> 00:08:51,890
I didn't expect this segment today.

275
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,680
They've already
made a bet with each other.

276
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,840
We made a bet before too.

277
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,960
I don't know if you remember.

278
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,520
