403
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:29,980
Thank you.

404
00:12:29,980 --> 00:12:31,420
(Follows along)
Thank you so much.

405
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:33,120
Thanks for carrying it.

406
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:37,920
