446
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:44,720
But their kitchen is huge.

447
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:46,400
It's a really big kitchen.

448
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:48,460
What we need is some alone time.

449
00:13:48,460 --> 00:13:49,960
(Key point: alone time)
True.

450
00:13:51,180 --> 00:13:52,220
