too aggressively.

544
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:16,560
He quietly shows he cares.

545
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:17,240
The two of them

546
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:18,560
have this unspoken chemistry.

547
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:20,320
I love that.

548
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:21,800
I'm shipping them.

549
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:23,080
Me too.

550
00:16:23,540 --> 00:16:25,900
After that, I was often alone.

551
00:16:26,010 --> 00:16:26,750
I wanted some company,

552
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:28,370
