556
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:33,530
I thought it was adorable.

557
00:16:34,060 --> 00:16:35,350
Then I became more outgoing.

558
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,480
Much better than two days ago.

559
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:38,160
(Right)
Definitely.

560
00:16:38,190 --> 00:16:39,760
I've relaxed a little now.

561
00:16:39,760 --> 00:16:40,840
Once there's a spark,

562
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,040
(I need to)
